Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "We're seriously outmatched... I think our
best bet would be to run.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "There will be no running today... Not when
the Triforce of Power is within my grasp!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "I sense a sacred power coming from the keeps.
If you squash that, their hope will crumble.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "They're desperate to try to help the sorceress
escape. I do hope we'll get to have our fun...",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Everyone! Draw Ghirahim and Zant to the
keeps!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "That girl... What sort of crafty scheme is
she up to?",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Yes! We've trapped Ghirahim!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Now's our chance! Let's push back against
the enemy's forces together!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "All right! We trapped Zant too!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "We should try to push back the enemy
wherever possible!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "The Hyrulean support troops will be here
soon! Everyone, hold tight until then!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "My actions have resulted in terrible failure...
I'll try to make up for it with my future deeds.",
  "1.0.13.0" => "A little girl's clever ruse means nothing to
me.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Um, I apologize... I'll fix this situation as
soon as I can!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "Do you expect me to care about some foolish
game a little girl wants to play with us?",
  "1.0.16.0" => "They've extinguished the sacred power!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "You have nowhere else to run...
Give me the Triforce of Power!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Zant was defeated! That'll show you the
might of the Goron people!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "We took down Ghirahim! It wasn't even
that hard!",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Lana, do you need our help?",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Impa! Thanks for coming!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Sheikah are trained from birth in secret
arts of war. These monsters will not win.",
  "1.0.23.0" => "You have defeated a phantom double.
You must be proud.",
  "1.0.24.0" => "A double? Heh. You act as if I've never
used that trick myself...",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Defeat the real one and the doubles
should vanish!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "Impa will lose her composure if we
threaten Lana... Then she'll reveal herself!",
  "1.0.27.0" => "That's not a bad idea...",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Another phantom.",
  "1.0.29.0" => "Let us force Lana to reveal herself to us.
To the Allied Base!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "What?! The enemy's already here?!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Lana, be careful! I'm on my way to help!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Heh heh... Looks like we've found the
REAL one...",
  "1.0.33.0" => "We've seen through your little tricks. Now
prepare to hand over what is rightfully mine.",
  "1.0.34.0" => "You're no match for generations of
Sheikah wisdom. None are.",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Urgh... My plan...has failed!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Hrah! Pests!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "H-how did they see through it...? My doubles
won't be strong enough to stop them...",
  "1.0.38.0" => "The plan has been set in motion... Even if
I fall, Lana will be able to escape...",
  "1.0.39.0" => "All that remains is that sorcerer girl.",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Everything is set... Lana will escape, even
if it means I will not...",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Protect Lana!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "What is it you think you can accomplish?
Deal with them, and capture the sorceress!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "The Triforce of Power is mine to possess!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "What? More doubles? How hard must it be
to capture ONE LITTLE GIRL?!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Lana! Use the Magic Circle to flee!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "There will be NO fleeing!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "You're quite powerless all alone...",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Perhaps...perhaps I have the ability to split
myself into copies, just like...Cia...",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Huh? This little girl's division seems different...
It seems each of the duplicates is the real one!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Chase the girls! Do not let any of them
get away!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "I'll chase the westbound sorceress!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "I'll try to cut off the eastbound one, then.
She'll regret ever trying to fool us!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Almost! I have to keep going! I just have to
use a little magic to give myself an edge!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Foolish girl... She's only wasting her
energy.",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Hurry, Lana! Get to the Magic Circle before
they can catch you!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "After her! Don't let her get away!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "She's going to get away!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "You! Wait!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "All that trouble...but it was worth it!
HA HA HA!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Now I just need the remaining two pieces.
Hyrule Castle is our next stop!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Huh... Huh... My ambitions...are getting the
best of me...",
  "1.0.62.0" => "Hmm. I'll admit your clever little tricks
worked better than I expected.",
  "1.0.63.0" => "Perfect! We have Zant right where we want
him!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "We might just have the advantage in this
battle, don't you think?",
  "1.0.65.0" => "I bet we'll end this all if we just capture
that base! C'mon! Someone help me do it!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Go, go! I'm rooting for you!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "We'll send the enemy packing, even if it
takes every last ounce of our strength!",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Only one remains. Come! Let us finish this!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Stop running! Face your ultimate fate!",
}